---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import disney from '../assets/brand/disney.svg';
import abc from '../assets/brand/abc.svg';
import zico from '../assets/brand/zico.svg';
import jamba from '../assets/brand/jamba.svg';
---
<BaseLayout title="Company" description="HardMagic is a privately owned media conglomerate combining creative direction, growth, production, GenAI, software, research, and compute to shape what industries become next.">
  <section class="page-hero company-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow dark">HardMagic Corporation · Delaware, USA</p><h1>One company.<br />An entire <em>media world.</em></h1><p>Privately owned. Founder-led. Making magic across brands, industries, audiences, and technology since 1999.</p><div class="company-hero-actions"><a class="button dark-button" href="contact/">Bring us a mandate</a><a class="text-link" href="briefs/modern-media-agency-transformation-playbook/">Read the transformation brief →</a></div></section>
  <section class="company-story"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">The company now</p><h2>We do not follow where media is going. We build the capability that moves it.</h2></div><div><p>HardMagic is an independent media conglomerate: creative direction, growth strategy, production, intelligent media, proprietary software, research, and compute under one direction.</p><p>Our creative directors and growth experts work across the whole system—from the boardroom decision and brand architecture to the campaign, platform, product, audience, and operating model. We help corporations sense a change early, turn it into a position people can desire, and build the machinery to keep that position coherent at scale.</p><p>For more than twenty-five years, the forms have changed while the practice has remained: dream with conviction, speak with precision, then do the hard work that makes the vision real.</p><div class="company-story-actions"><a class="button ghost" href="services/">Explore our capabilities</a><a class="text-link" href="engagements/">See how we engage →</a></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="media-constellation" aria-labelledby="constellation-title">
    <div class="shell"><header><p class="eyebrow">The HardMagic constellation</p><h2 id="constellation-title">Creative power is not<br />one department.</h2><p>A corporation can engage one discipline or direct the entire constellation toward a category, transformation, campaign, or product.</p></header><div class="constellation-grid"><a href="services/creative-direction/"><span>01</span><h3>Creative direction</h3><p>Premise, taste, identity, canon, and the human authority that keeps every expression coherent.</p><b>Direct the world →</b></a><a href="services/marketing-consulting/"><span>02</span><h3>Growth + marketing</h3><p>Positioning, demand, audience strategy, launch systems, and the operating choices that move a market.</p><b>Build demand →</b></a><a href="services/campaign-production/"><span>03</span><h3>Media production</h3><p>Campaigns, film, image, sound, events, digital experiences, and the systems behind continuous publishing.</p><b>Make the campaign →</b></a><a href="engagements/genai-lab/"><span>04</span><h3>Creative data lab</h3><p>Governed experiments, evaluation, predictive and generative workflows, and promotion gates for enterprise adoption.</p><b>Enter the lab →</b></a><a href="products/"><span>05</span><h3>Products + agents</h3><p>WireMark, HardMagic Studio, HardMagic Agent CLI, Web Magic, and the interfaces that make intent executable.</p><b>Inspect the products →</b></a><a href="products/gpu-router/"><span>06</span><h3>Compute</h3><p>A policy-aware GPU routing layer spanning local and cloud inference for resilient creative operations.</p><b>Explore GPU Router →</b></a></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="hollywood-spell" aria-labelledby="hollywood-title">
    <div class="hollywood-spell-word" aria-hidden="true"><span>holly</span><span>wood</span></div>
    <div class="shell hollywood-spell-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A material. A myth. A city of dreams.</p><h2 id="hollywood-title">Holly wood.<br /><em>Hollywood.</em></h2><div><p>Holly—the evergreen tree—has carried associations of winter endurance, returning spring, myth, and magic in European traditions. Its wood belongs to a timeless material imagination: nature made symbolic, meaning made tangible.</p><p>The city of Hollywood arrived at its name by another history, not from a magician’s wand. Yet the accidental poetry is perfect. Split the word in the imagination—<i>holly wood / Hollywood</i>—and folklore meets a city whose images travel the world, alter consciousness, and make millions of people believe in realities that did not exist before the lights came up.</p><p>That threshold is where HardMagic works. Not illusion instead of truth, but imagination with enough craft, strategy, and force to become culture.</p></div><p class="source-note">The folklore and the place-name are distinct histories. Sources: <a href="https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/discover/nature/trees-plants/five-things-you-never-knew-about-holly" rel="external">National Trust on holly folklore ↗</a> · <a href="https://planning.lacity.gov/StaffRpt/InitialRpts/DIR-2017-1073.pdf" rel="external">Los Angeles City Planning on Hollywood’s name ↗</a></p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="principles shell section-pad"><p class="eyebrow dark">Our own abracadabra</p><h2>Words become worlds.<br />Wonder becomes work.</h2><div class="principle-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Sense the unseen</h3><p>We notice the cultural current before it settles into a category.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Name the future</h3><p>Clear language gives imagination a form other people can enter.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Practice respectful magic</h3><p>Across cultures, symbol, story, rhythm, pattern, movement, and gathering carry meaning. We learn with respect; we do not turn sacred identities into decoration.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Do the hard magic</h3><p>Inspiration matters. Making it coherent, useful, beautiful, and real is the craft.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="company-record" aria-labelledby="record-title"><div class="shell"><header><p class="eyebrow">Selected company experience</p><h2 id="record-title">The next category<br />often starts quietly.</h2><p>HardMagic leadership supplied and approved these experience notes. Records clarifying entity, role, dates, scope, and relevant references are available during qualified diligence; no audience, revenue, or industry-wide outcome is implied.</p></header><ol><li><span>01 / Movement media</span><h3>Yoga met YouTube.</h3><p>HardMagic leadership reports building brand, marketing, and media work that brought yoga teaching into online video and creator-led distribution while those behaviors were still emerging.</p><a href="portfolio/pranashama/">See the documented brand transformation →</a></li><li><span>02 / Fashion</span><h3>Speed became a brand language.</h3><p>HardMagic leadership reports developing fashion branding and image systems around the immediacy, desire, and rapid cultural rhythm that would define fast-fashion marketing.</p><a href="services/brand-systems/">Explore brand systems →</a></li><li><span>03 / On-demand economy</span><h3>Beauty came to the door.</h3><p>HardMagic leadership reports running marketing campaigns for Beauty on Demand: a service model connecting makeup artists, stylists, and hair artists with at-home beauty experiences.</p><a href="contact/marketing-consulting/">Discuss category creation →</a></li><li><span>04 / Workforce experience</span><h3>Wellness became an internal event.</h3><p>HardMagic leadership reports producing marketing events for Nike designed to engage its own staff in health and fitness.</p><a href="contact/creative-direction/">Commission an experience →</a></li><li><span>05 / Applied intelligence</span><h3>AI before the present wave.</h3><p>HardMagic leadership reports more than fifteen years of applied AI work and award-recognized predictive-AI practice. Today that line continues through generative media, agents, evaluation, and compute.</p><a href="briefs/generative-media-operating-system/">Read the GenAI operating-system brief →</a></li></ol></div></section>
  <section class="brand-history"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Selected experience</p><h2>Our founder’s work crosses recognized stages, brands, media, products, and places.</h2><div class="logo-row"><img src={disney.src} alt="The Walt Disney Company" /><img src={abc.src} alt="ABC" /><img src={zico.src} alt="ZICO" /><img src={jamba.src} alt="Jamba" /></div><p class="quiet">Selected relationships and project experience. Official vector marks belong to their respective owners and do not imply current endorsement.</p><a class="text-link" href="portfolio/">Explore the creative-direction portfolio →</a></div></section>
  <section class="closing-cta shell section-pad"><p class="eyebrow dark">Work with HardMagic</p><h2>Do not buy more output.<br />Build the advantage.</h2><p>Bring us a category to create, a corporate transformation to direct, or a media capability that has to exist before the competition understands why.</p><div class="closing-actions"><a class="button dark-button" href="contact/">Start a corporate conversation</a><a class="text-link" href="briefs/">Choose an executive brief →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .company-hero-actions,.company-story-actions,.closing-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.2rem;margin-top:2rem}.company-hero-actions .text-link,.company-story-actions .text-link{color:inherit}.media-constellation{padding-block:clamp(6rem,10vw,11rem);background:#050405;color:#f6edf1}.media-constellation header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,9rem);align-items:end;margin-bottom:4rem}.media-constellation header .eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1}.media-constellation header h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7.6rem)}.media-constellation header>p:last-child{max-width:38rem;margin:0;color:#b9adb3;font-size:1.1rem}.constellation-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);border-top:1px solid #40353a}.constellation-grid a{grid-column:span 4;display:flex;min-height:25rem;padding:2rem;flex-direction:column;border-right:1px solid #40353a;border-bottom:1px solid #40353a;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.constellation-grid a:nth-child(3n+1){border-left:1px solid #40353a}.constellation-grid span{color:#f07594;font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.14em}.constellation-grid h3{margin:auto 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,2.5vw,3rem)}.constellation-grid p{color:#b9adb3}.constellation-grid b{margin-top:1.5rem;color:#f07594;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase}.constellation-grid a:hover{background:#7e1031}.constellation-grid a:hover p,.constellation-grid a:hover b{color:#fff}.company-record{padding-block:clamp(6rem,11vw,12rem);background:#e9ded6;color:#120c0f}.company-record header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,8rem);align-items:end;margin-bottom:4rem}.company-record header .eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1}.company-record header h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7.5rem)}.company-record header>p:last-child{max-width:42rem;margin:0;color:#65585e}.company-record ol{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(18,12,15,.25)}.company-record li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:12rem minmax(14rem,.65fr) minmax(18rem,1fr) auto;gap:2rem;align-items:start;padding:2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(18,12,15,.25)}.company-record li>span{color:#7e1031;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.company-record h3{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.4vw,2.8rem)}.company-record li p{margin:0;color:#55494f}.company-record li a{font-size:.66rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;text-underline-offset:.25em}.closing-cta>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:48rem;margin-inline:auto;color:#c5b9c0;font-size:1.08rem}.closing-actions{justify-content:center}.closing-actions .text-link{color:#f07594}
  .company-record header .eyebrow{color:var(--wine)}
  @media(max-width:900px){.media-constellation header,.company-record header{grid-template-columns:1fr}.constellation-grid a{grid-column:span 6}.constellation-grid a:nth-child(3n+1){border-left:0}.constellation-grid a:nth-child(odd){border-left:1px solid #40353a}.company-record li{grid-template-columns:8rem 1fr}.company-record li p,.company-record li a{grid-column:2}}
  @media(max-width:620px){.company-hero-actions,.company-story-actions,.closing-actions{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.company-hero-actions .button,.company-story-actions .button,.closing-actions .button{width:100%}.media-constellation header h2,.company-record header h2{font-size:clamp(3.1rem,14vw,4.7rem);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.constellation-grid{display:block}.constellation-grid a{min-height:21rem;border-left:1px solid #40353a}.company-record li{display:block}.company-record li>*{display:block;margin-top:1rem}.company-record li p,.company-record li a{grid-column:auto}.company-record h3{margin-top:1.5rem}}
</style>
